#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "Gate Cutting para Reducir el Ancho del Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr "En este notebook, seguiremos los pasos de un [patrón de Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) usando **circuit cutting** para reducir el número de qubits en un circuito. Cortaremos Gates para poder reconstruir el valor esperado de un circuito de cuatro qubits usando solo experimentos de dos qubits.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Estos son los pasos que seguiremos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 1: Mapear el problema a circuits cuánticos y operadores**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mapear el hamiltoniano a un circuito cuántico.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 2: Optimizar para el hardware objetivo** [_Usa el cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cortar el circuito y el observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpilar los subexperimentos para el hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 3: Ejecutar en el hardware objetivo**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Ejecutar los subexperimentos obtenidos en el Paso 2 usando una primitiva `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Paso 4: Post-procesar los resultados** [_Usa el cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combinar los resultados del Paso 3 para reconstruir el valor esperado del observable en cuestión.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Paso 1: Mapear {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Crear un circuito para cortar {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Especificar un observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Paso 2: Optimizar {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate the circuit and observable according to a specified qubit partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"
msgstr "Separar el circuito y el observable según una partición de qubits especificada {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each label in `partition_labels` corresponds to the `circuit` qubit in the same index. Qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be cut.\n"
msgstr "Cada etiqueta en `partition_labels` corresponde al qubit del `circuit` en el mismo índice. Los qubits que comparten una etiqueta de partición común se agruparán, y los puertas no locales que abarquen más de una partición serán cortados.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `partition_problem` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** El argumento ``observables`` de `partition_problem` es de tipo `PauliList`. Los coeficientes y las fases de los términos del observable se ignoran durante la descomposición del problema y la ejecución de los subexperimentos. Pueden volver a aplicarse durante la reconstrucción del valor esperado.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "Visualizar el problema descompuesto {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama del circuito cuántico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Calcular la sobrecarga de muestreo para los cortes elegidos {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^2$.\n"
msgstr "Aquí cortamos dos Gates CNOT, lo que resulta en una sobrecarga de muestreo de $9^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para más información sobre la sobrecarga de muestreo generada por el circuit cutting, consulta el [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Generar los subexperimentos para ejecutar en el Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` acepta los argumentos `circuits`/`observables` como diccionarios que mapean etiquetas de partición de qubits a los respectivos `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para simular el valor esperado del circuito de tamaño completo, se generan muchos subexperimentos a partir de la distribución de cuasiprobabilidad conjunta de los puertas descompuestos y luego se ejecutan en uno o más Backends. El número de muestras tomadas de la distribución se controla con `num_samples`, y se da un coeficiente combinado para cada muestra única. Para más información sobre cómo se calculan los coeficientes, consulta el [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Elegir un Backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr "Aquí usamos un Backend falso, lo que hará que Qiskit Runtime se ejecute en modo local (es decir, en un simulador local).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Preparar los subexperimentos para el Backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Debemos transpilar los circuits con nuestro Backend como objetivo antes de enviarlos a Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Paso 3: Ejecutar {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Ejecutar los subexperimentos usando la primitiva Sampler de Qiskit Runtime {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Paso 4: Post-procesar {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Reconstruir el valor esperado {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Reconstruye los valores esperados para cada término del observable y combínalos para reconstruir el valor esperado del observable original.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Comparar el valor esperado reconstruido con el valor esperado exacto del circuito y observable originales {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
